X-WR-CALNAME:Weaver line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-03T23:00:00&endDate=2026-09-04T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWEAVER LINE: Monday 31 August\, Tuesday 1\, Wednesday 2 and Thursday 3 September\, after 2245 each evening\, no service between Hackney Downs and Enfield Town / Cheshunt. Last through trains operate at 2243 from Liverpool Street to Cheshunt\, 2250 from Enfield Town to Liverpool Street\, 2258 from Liverpool Street to Enfield Town and 2259 from Cheshunt to Liverpool Street. Use Clapton for Rectory Road and Stoke Newington\, and local London Buses services for Stamford Hill. Replacement buses operate. The limited number of southbound GREATER ANGLIA and STANSTED EXPRESS trains after midnight which usually call at Seven Sisters are diverted via Tottenham Hale instead
DTEND:20260904T002900Z
DTSTART:20260903T230000Z
SUMMARY:Weaver line: Part Closure
